{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2337"},"reason":"Body extended in all three languages (new passage and table row) to carry the new fact f28013 (Mutti); a few connecting phrases adjusted so the page still reads as one.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_image_of_Angela_Merkel"},{"url":"https://www.berliner-zeitung.de/article/183110"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",429],["+"," Over those years \"Kohl's girl\" turned into \"Mutti\" – German for \"Mum\" – a nickname first used with a sneer that her supporters soon adopted with affection, for a chancellor who governed in a calm, unflashy, almost maternal style."],["=",400]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",399],["+"," In diesen Jahren wurde aus „Kohls Mädchen“ „Mutti“ – ein Spitzname, zunächst spöttisch gemeint, den ihre Anhänger bald liebevoll übernahmen, für eine Kanzlerin, die ruhig, unaufgeregt und fast mütterlich regierte."],["=",332]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",375],["+"," За эти годы «девочка Коля» превратилась в «Мутти» — по-немецки «мамочка»: прозвище, поначалу насмешливое, её сторонники вскоре подхватили с нежностью — для канцлера, которая правила спокойно, без показного блеска, почти по-матерински."],["=",346]]}],"hash":"5c53e7cfa7d2"},
